      "content": "i get that ur not a doctor but i really dont want to wait 3 days for an appointment and feel this bad. it feels like a bacterial thing since my throat is so swollen. if i just take a normal dose like 500mg twice a day for a few days would that be okay to see if it helps? it's better than nothing right?",
